  "text": " Web pages change, links break, articles vanish behind paywalls. Calm PDF freezes any page exactly as it looks today. Copy the link, paste it, hit convert. Our server loads the page like a real browser, then packages it as a clean PDF. No ads, no sidebars, no missing images. Pick your paper size, orientation and margins, or just keep the defaults. Articles, images, GitHub files, even raw JSON. No sign-up, no watermark, completely free.",
